    1. Pick num_frames from 1-4; for each pick side from {5, 7, 9}
    2. Compute min grid side = enough to pack all frames with >=1 gap between each pair and >=0 margin to edges; add 0-3 padding; clamp to 7-20
    3. Place frames on grid greedily: for each frame, find random top-left such that bbox fits in grid and has >=1 cell separation from all previously placed frames
    4. Draw each frame as red border; place red marker at center of interior; rest stays black
```
